<title>TURKEY: Turkish Tupras sells Glencore 18,000 T naphtha.</title>
<headline>Turkish Tupras sells Glencore 18,000 T naphtha.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's state refinery Tupras sold 18,000 tonnes of naphtha through a tender to Glencore with a premium of $6.67 per tonne, Tupras said in a statement.</p>
<p>The FOB shipment will be on April 18-20 from Aliaga refinery, it said.</p>
<p>The tender was held on April 2.</p>
<p>-- Ankara newsroom, 90-312-446 2940</p>
